                  "section": "1.3",
                  "section_heading": "Holidays during PTO",
                  "text": "A company holiday that falls inside your PTO dates is not deducted from your PTO. When you count the PTO days a request will use, leave out weekends and your home office's company holidays. For example, a Denver employee taking Wednesday to Friday off in a week where Wednesday is a US company holiday uses 2 PTO days, not 3. See also RSE-PTO-01 \u00a73.2.",
